WEBVTT

00:01:04.565 --> 00:01:06.692
Is Nibbler stoked for the big pet show?

00:01:06.775 --> 00:01:09.862
He oughta be, with all the strict training
I've been putting him through.

00:01:09.945 --> 00:01:12.239
Nibbler, roll over and you get a ham.

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:15.284
Roll over. Roll over for the ham.

00:01:18.412 --> 00:01:20.205
You are so adorable.

00:01:20.289 --> 00:01:21.748
Who wants a ham?

00:01:24.376 --> 00:01:25.961
Zooka barooka!

00:01:26.044 --> 00:01:30.507
First prize is $500
and a year's supply of dog food!

00:01:30.591 --> 00:01:32.885
$500, you say?

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:35.137
Dog food, you say?

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:41.727
Man, that dog
is gonna be hard to beat.

00:01:42.311 --> 00:01:43.645
Look at him bring in the sheep.

00:01:43.729 --> 00:01:45.355
One sheep, two sheep...

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:47.691
Three sheep.

00:01:49.568 --> 00:01:50.569
The dog is good.

00:01:50.652 --> 00:01:53.322
But our real competition
is the hypno-toad.

00:02:12.382 --> 00:02:13.842
Your turn, Nibbler, honey.

00:02:13.926 --> 00:02:15.177
Herd those sheep!

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:19.973
Come on, Nibbler!

00:02:27.314 --> 00:02:29.107
Ma'am, I have a late entry.

00:02:29.191 --> 00:02:32.361
My hard-shelled whooping terrier,
Mr. Zoidberg.

00:02:39.201 --> 00:02:40.744
Faster! Faster!

00:02:49.378 --> 00:02:51.004
- Ow!
- Suck in that gut!

00:02:51.088 --> 00:02:52.464
You want to be spayed?

00:02:52.881 --> 00:02:53.924
Ah.

00:02:56.718 --> 00:02:58.053
Silence, you cur!

00:02:58.136 --> 00:02:59.471
Puff out that brisket.

00:03:06.353 --> 00:03:08.021
I should be weeping!

00:03:08.105 --> 00:03:09.481
I'm not weeping!

00:03:17.698 --> 00:03:19.074
I love these things.

00:03:22.411 --> 00:03:23.745
Shake paws, Nibbler.

00:03:23.829 --> 00:03:25.455
Come on. Shake.

00:03:25.539 --> 00:03:26.999
He might be a little hungry.

00:03:27.082 --> 00:03:28.208
Shake, boy!

00:03:28.292 --> 00:03:31.086
Usually he's had more ham by now. Shake!

00:03:59.781 --> 00:04:03.327
Third prize,
a party-sized keg of guinea pigs,

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:05.871
goes to Dave Spiegel

00:04:05.954 --> 00:04:07.831
and his owner, Fluffers.

00:04:10.292 --> 00:04:11.502
Second prize,

00:04:11.585 --> 00:04:14.546
this lovely afghan made from an Afghan,

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:16.715
goes to Bender

00:04:16.798 --> 00:04:19.092
and his whooping terrier!

00:04:19.176 --> 00:04:20.594
Second place?

00:04:20.677 --> 00:04:22.846
That's a fancy word for losing!

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:25.057
You didn't stick your landing!

00:04:25.516 --> 00:04:26.975
Forgive me, my friend.

00:04:27.059 --> 00:04:28.143
Never!

00:04:28.227 --> 00:04:30.229
And before we announce the winner,

00:04:30.312 --> 00:04:33.357
we have a special award
for a first-time contestant.

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:36.568
Miss Leela and her mystery pet, Nibbler.

00:04:37.194 --> 00:04:38.278
Me?

00:04:38.362 --> 00:04:40.155
Award? Him?

00:04:40.239 --> 00:04:41.657
Me? Good?

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:45.410
That's just the kind of eloquence
you'd expect from the owner of

00:04:45.494 --> 00:04:47.663
Dumbest Pet in Show!

00:04:51.875 --> 00:04:53.919
And the grand-prize winner,

00:04:54.878 --> 00:04:57.005
the hypno-toad.

00:05:00.425 --> 00:05:03.762
All glory to the hypno-toad.

00:05:07.891 --> 00:05:09.726
Maybe they're right.

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:11.061
Maybe Nibbler is dumb.

00:05:11.144 --> 00:05:12.521
Don't listen to them, Leela.

00:05:12.604 --> 00:05:15.232
People said I was dumb, but I proved them.

00:05:16.149 --> 00:05:17.526
Good news, everyone!

00:05:17.609 --> 00:05:21.196
We were supposed to make
a delivery to the planet Tweenis 12,

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:23.532
but it's been completely destroyed.

00:05:23.615 --> 00:05:24.825
Why is that good news?

00:05:24.908 --> 00:05:26.285
They paid in advance.

00:05:27.494 --> 00:05:29.872
- Excuse me.
- This is mighty strange.

00:05:31.081 --> 00:05:33.584
First the civilization
of Space Rome collapsed,

00:05:33.667 --> 00:05:36.044
then Don Martin III went kerflooey,

00:05:36.128 --> 00:05:37.963
and now Tweenis 12.

00:05:38.046 --> 00:05:39.840
Looks like this planet is next in line.

00:05:39.923 --> 00:05:40.924
That's Earth.

00:05:41.925 --> 00:05:43.510
The planet we live on?

00:05:43.594 --> 00:05:45.220
I'd hate to be those guys.

00:05:52.853 --> 00:05:53.937
What's got into him?

00:05:54.021 --> 00:05:56.815
He's twitching like Zoidberg
when someone mentions the word "food."

00:05:56.899 --> 00:05:58.650
What now?

00:06:00.527 --> 00:06:02.654
No! Nibbler, come back!

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:08.410
Too bad Nibbler's not around.

00:06:08.493 --> 00:06:12.539
I guess I'll have to eat this raw,
dripping ham by myself.

00:06:17.419 --> 00:06:18.420
Nibbler?

00:06:19.296 --> 00:06:20.881
Nibbler, you're scaring me.

00:06:30.432 --> 00:06:32.434
Nibbler!

00:06:40.901 --> 00:06:42.444
Am I going crazy?

00:06:42.528 --> 00:06:45.781
Have my years of wild hedonism
finally caught up with me?

00:06:55.123 --> 00:06:56.542
Nibbler, help!

00:06:56.625 --> 00:06:58.126
Don't leave me here!

00:07:15.477 --> 00:07:18.438
Nibbler, could you scooch
the seat up just a little bit?

00:07:34.913 --> 00:07:35.914
Leela back yet?

00:07:35.998 --> 00:07:37.165
Fry, help me!

00:07:37.249 --> 00:07:38.542
My heart stopped beating!

00:07:38.625 --> 00:07:40.669
You don't have a heart. You're a robot.

00:07:40.752 --> 00:07:42.254
Sure. Right.

00:07:42.754 --> 00:07:43.755
Robot.

00:07:44.047 --> 00:07:47.050
Oh, Fry, my skin is all dry and clanky!

00:07:47.134 --> 00:07:49.386
Well, yeah. Robots are made of metal.

00:07:49.469 --> 00:07:51.346
Am I a robot?

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:53.682
Bender, if this is some kind of scam,
I don't get it.

00:07:53.765 --> 00:07:55.601
You already have my power of attorney.

00:07:56.101 --> 00:07:57.102
Fry!

00:07:59.062 --> 00:08:00.147
My skin!

00:08:00.439 --> 00:08:02.357
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:08:02.441 --> 00:08:03.609
I'm a genius.

00:08:03.734 --> 00:08:05.027
Ow! Ow!

00:08:07.404 --> 00:08:10.073
Dr. Zoidberg, why is everyone
acting so weird?

00:08:10.157 --> 00:08:11.700
Zoidbee want balloon.

00:08:11.783 --> 00:08:13.076
Want balloon now!

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:15.037
Zoidbee want go outside!

00:08:15.412 --> 00:08:17.497
I just let you back in!

00:08:19.791 --> 00:08:20.876
This is unbelievable.

00:08:20.959 --> 00:08:23.003
I thought you were a furry little moron,

00:08:23.086 --> 00:08:26.131
but here you are
flying an adorable spaceship.

00:08:26.215 --> 00:08:27.758
If only you could talk.

00:08:29.510 --> 00:08:31.345
Wait! I understood that.

00:08:34.389 --> 00:08:37.351
You say you're transmitting
your thoughts directly to my brain?

00:08:39.895 --> 00:08:43.815
You say those awful flying brains
are making everyone on Earth stupid?

00:08:46.068 --> 00:08:48.320
Oh! Stupider.

00:08:48.403 --> 00:08:49.988
And you go on to say

00:08:50.072 --> 00:08:51.823
that we're headed for your home planet,

00:08:51.907 --> 00:08:54.618
where your race has lived
since the beginning of the universe?

00:08:55.869 --> 00:08:58.413
So, how did the universe begin?

00:09:04.878 --> 00:09:06.964
Then the meaning of existence...

00:09:07.256 --> 00:09:09.299
So every religion is wrong!

00:09:29.194 --> 00:09:30.195
You fell.

00:09:30.279 --> 00:09:31.280
Hi!

00:09:31.363 --> 00:09:33.156
Today some bad things happened.

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:34.366
One bad thing was

00:09:34.449 --> 00:09:36.451
a train got crashed in New Jersey.

00:09:36.535 --> 00:09:37.744
Want to see?

00:09:37.828 --> 00:09:41.081
People won't be late for work, though,
because the governor lady said,

00:09:41.164 --> 00:09:43.333
"I'm sending in more trains."

00:09:47.754 --> 00:09:50.674
Morbo can't understand his teleprompter.

00:09:50.757 --> 00:09:54.344
He forgot how you say that letter
that looks like a man with a hat.

00:09:54.428 --> 00:09:56.597
It's a "T." It goes "tuh."

00:09:56.680 --> 00:09:58.098
Hello, little man.

00:09:58.182 --> 00:09:59.641
I will destroy you!

00:09:59.725 --> 00:10:02.644
Man, even the news monster
is acting strange.

00:10:02.728 --> 00:10:03.729
What are we gonna do?

00:10:03.812 --> 00:10:05.230
Duh. I know!

00:10:05.314 --> 00:10:06.815
Let's play the lottery!

00:10:06.899 --> 00:10:08.734
No! Let's buy Internet stock.

00:10:08.817 --> 00:10:09.818
On margin!

00:10:09.902 --> 00:10:11.987
Zoidbee wanna buy on margin.

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:14.489
Look at me! I'm invisible.

00:10:14.573 --> 00:10:16.867
Wait a minute.
I know what's going on here.

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:18.452
You've all become idiots!

00:10:18.535 --> 00:10:20.746
Hey, let's all join the Reform Party!

00:10:20.829 --> 00:10:22.581
Oh, yeah!

00:10:38.931 --> 00:10:40.098
Welcome back, Lord Nibbler,

00:10:40.182 --> 00:10:43.310
Ambassador to Earth,
home world of the pizza bagel.

00:10:43.393 --> 00:10:46.355
Thank you. I bear many receipts
for reimbursement.

00:10:46.438 --> 00:10:49.399
The Four welcomes a friendship
to you as well, Leela.

00:10:49.483 --> 00:10:50.984
We shall manipulate your mind,

00:10:51.068 --> 00:10:53.195
so we appear to be speaking your language.

00:10:53.278 --> 00:10:55.030
Do not be afraid, my child.

00:10:55.113 --> 00:10:56.323
I'm not afraid.

00:10:56.657 --> 00:10:58.116
Uh, good. Good.

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:00.619
So, your real name is Lord Nibbler?

00:11:00.702 --> 00:11:01.787
That's a coincidence.

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:03.580
That name is for your sake.

00:11:03.664 --> 00:11:07.209
In the time it would take to pronounce
one letter of my true name,

00:11:07.292 --> 00:11:09.962
a trillion cosmoses
would flare into existence

00:11:10.045 --> 00:11:11.547
and sink into eternal night.

00:11:11.713 --> 00:11:13.674
You're all so cute!

00:11:13.757 --> 00:11:14.758
No, we're not.

00:11:14.842 --> 00:11:17.302
We Nibblonians are
an ancient and powerful race.

00:11:17.386 --> 00:11:18.637
Behold.

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:22.057
When the universe was forged
in the crucible of the Big Bang,

00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:25.435
our mighty race was already 17 years old.

00:11:25.561 --> 00:11:27.062
Aw!

00:11:28.272 --> 00:11:29.273
For the first

00:11:29.356 --> 00:11:31.733
millisecond of time, things were okay.

00:11:31.817 --> 00:11:34.111
But then there arose a terrible enemy,

00:11:34.194 --> 00:11:35.904
the Brain Spawn.

00:11:39.199 --> 00:11:42.327
Ever since, we have waged unceasing war

00:11:42.411 --> 00:11:44.246
against these dreadful...

00:11:44.329 --> 00:11:45.414
Lunch is ready.

00:11:45.497 --> 00:11:48.542
Then let the feast
of a thousand hams begin!

00:11:53.422 --> 00:11:56.508
So why are these Brain Spawn
attacking Earth, Nibbler?

00:11:56.592 --> 00:11:59.136
The Brain Spawn hate all consciousness.

00:11:59.219 --> 00:12:00.888
The thoughts of others screech at them

00:12:00.971 --> 00:12:04.266
like the forced laughs
of a billion art-house movie patrons.

00:12:04.349 --> 00:12:06.393
Thus they travel from world to world,

00:12:06.476 --> 00:12:07.769
making everyone stupid

00:12:07.853 --> 00:12:10.731
in order to wipe out
all thought in the universe.

00:12:10.814 --> 00:12:12.191
Wipe out all thought?

00:12:12.274 --> 00:12:13.275
My God!

00:12:13.358 --> 00:12:15.068
They're like flying televisions!

00:12:15.152 --> 00:12:17.738
And even we are powerless to stop them,

00:12:17.821 --> 00:12:19.990
fearsome though we are.

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:24.161
There is but one being
who can resist them.

00:12:24.244 --> 00:12:27.206
A child of destiny
whose bizarre brain-wave pattern

00:12:27.289 --> 00:12:29.416
makes him immune
to the Brain Spawn attack.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.252
He is the hope of the universe.

00:12:34.213 --> 00:12:35.964
The fate of your world,

00:12:36.048 --> 00:12:37.758
perhaps all worlds,

00:12:37.841 --> 00:12:39.885
rests in his special mind.

00:12:39.968 --> 00:12:41.887
Now, when you say "special"...

00:12:49.228 --> 00:12:51.897
Attention, New New Yorkers!

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:54.608
Stop acting so stupid!

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:09.831
Nibblonian fleet
holding at perimeter of Moron Zone,

00:13:09.915 --> 00:13:11.166
formerly known as Earth.

00:13:11.583 --> 00:13:14.169
Why would Fry be immune
to the flying brains?

00:13:14.253 --> 00:13:15.420
Because he doesn't shower?

00:13:15.504 --> 00:13:19.174
The Brain Spawn suppress intelligence
by attacking the delta brain wave.

00:13:19.633 --> 00:13:22.928
Every animal and robot in the universe
generates this wave,

00:13:23.011 --> 00:13:24.471
as do certain trees.

00:13:24.888 --> 00:13:26.640
Fry, however, does not.

00:13:28.559 --> 00:13:32.229
Somehow he has cobbled together
a random assortment of other brain waves

00:13:32.312 --> 00:13:33.564
into a working mind.

00:13:33.647 --> 00:13:36.024
Like a prom dress
made from carpet remnants.

00:13:36.108 --> 00:13:37.943
Yes, like your prom dress.

00:13:38.026 --> 00:13:40.863
The Brain Spawn are commanded
by a giant, evil brain

00:13:40.946 --> 00:13:43.407
with a gooey center of pure hate.

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:47.828
Only Fry, with his superior
yet inferior mind, can approach it.

00:13:47.911 --> 00:13:49.705
You must tell him to disable it.

00:13:49.788 --> 00:13:51.081
We will do the rest.

00:13:51.164 --> 00:13:52.332
You can count on me.

00:13:52.416 --> 00:13:53.417
No, we can't.

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:56.378
Once on Earth, you will be too stupid
to remember the message.

00:13:56.461 --> 00:13:58.297
That's why we wrote it down for you.

00:14:00.632 --> 00:14:03.594
We've also prepared
a bag lunch and some mittens.

00:14:05.429 --> 00:14:07.931
Time to reeducate you dunce bags.

00:14:08.015 --> 00:14:09.474
We'll start with U.S. presidents.

00:14:09.558 --> 00:14:12.394
This was our first president,
George Washington.

00:14:15.689 --> 00:14:18.442
Let's review. Who was our first president?

00:14:18.609 --> 00:14:20.736
Um...

00:14:21.153 --> 00:14:22.237
A pickle jar?

00:14:22.321 --> 00:14:23.697
Thomas Jefferson?

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:30.120
Leela! I've been so worried!

00:14:30.204 --> 00:14:31.413
Are you a bonehead?

00:14:31.496 --> 00:14:34.041
I have to tell...

00:14:34.875 --> 00:14:35.876
Must...

00:14:36.376 --> 00:14:37.628
Important...

00:14:38.545 --> 00:14:39.546
Something.

00:14:39.630 --> 00:14:42.424
Whoa, whoa. Slow down.
You're going a mile a minute.

00:14:42.508 --> 00:14:44.343
This! You for this.

00:14:44.426 --> 00:14:45.427
Thanks!

00:14:46.845 --> 00:14:48.222
No!

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:50.724
Ow!

00:14:50.807 --> 00:14:52.142
Fire hot!

00:14:52.226 --> 00:14:53.685
The professie will help.

00:14:55.437 --> 00:14:56.813
Fire indeed hot.

00:15:01.401 --> 00:15:04.196
Oh. Chester A. Arthur fall down.

00:15:04.279 --> 00:15:05.322
Brain.

00:15:05.405 --> 00:15:06.823
Brain make people dumb.

00:15:06.907 --> 00:15:07.908
No, Leela.

00:15:07.991 --> 00:15:10.202
Brain make people smart.

00:15:17.251 --> 00:15:19.920
You go fight biggest brain of all.

00:15:20.003 --> 00:15:21.338
Even bigger than those?

00:15:21.421 --> 00:15:23.006
Holy nuts! Where is it?

00:15:23.090 --> 00:15:24.091
I don't know.

00:15:24.341 --> 00:15:27.386
Hmm. A giant brain
is basically a giant nerd.

00:15:27.469 --> 00:15:29.555
And where would a giant nerd be?

00:15:31.849 --> 00:15:33.225
The library!

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:51.827
Pathetic human race.

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:55.956
Arranging their knowledge by category
just made it easier to absorb.

00:15:56.039 --> 00:15:57.457
Dewey, you fool.

00:15:57.541 --> 00:16:00.586
Your decimal system has played
right into my hands.

00:16:05.215 --> 00:16:06.633
What do you want?

00:16:06.717 --> 00:16:08.385
I'm here to kick your ass!

00:16:08.468 --> 00:16:09.803
Wishful thinking.

00:16:09.887 --> 00:16:13.098
We have long since evolved
beyond the need for asses.

00:16:17.811 --> 00:16:22.566
Odd. My stupefaction field is having
no effect on your ability to think.

00:16:22.649 --> 00:16:23.650
That's right!

00:16:23.734 --> 00:16:25.736
And I think you'll find
that a little knowledge

00:16:25.819 --> 00:16:27.321
is a dangerous thing!

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:30.741
Okay. Better think of a new plan.

00:16:30.824 --> 00:16:32.451
Come on, Fry, think.

00:16:32.534 --> 00:16:33.702
Thinking.

00:16:33.785 --> 00:16:35.078
Thinking...

00:16:37.664 --> 00:16:38.832
Stop that!

00:16:38.916 --> 00:16:40.667
Hey, thinking hurts him.

00:16:40.751 --> 00:16:42.419
Maybe I can think of a way to use that.

00:16:45.005 --> 00:16:47.090
Aha! Prepare to be thought at!

00:16:47.174 --> 00:16:48.884
Leela, give me a topic.

00:16:49.218 --> 00:16:50.427
Duh!

00:16:50.677 --> 00:16:52.262
Seriously. I can't think of anything.

00:16:55.599 --> 00:16:57.518
I gotta find something to make me think.

00:16:57.601 --> 00:16:59.311
Hardy Boys. Too easy.

00:16:59.394 --> 00:17:01.021
Nancy Drew. Too hard.

00:17:01.396 --> 00:17:03.941
Ah! Perfect! Bonfire of the Vanities!

00:17:04.775 --> 00:17:07.444
No! It's unbearable!

00:17:11.198 --> 00:17:12.866
The brains are weakening.

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:14.910
Nibblonians to Nibble stations.

00:17:14.993 --> 00:17:17.663
Prepare Cuddle Bug
for deployment in 40 nibblets.

00:17:17.955 --> 00:17:20.374
Sometimes I fear we are cute.

00:17:20.457 --> 00:17:22.292
Oh! Niggle-snoosh!

00:17:22.376 --> 00:17:24.962
Take that! And that!

00:17:25.045 --> 00:17:27.464
This sentence I don't understand,
but take this one!

00:17:28.757 --> 00:17:30.676
You have not won yet.

00:17:30.759 --> 00:17:34.304
Each book in this room
is a gateway to a mental realm,

00:17:34.388 --> 00:17:38.141
and I shall take you there
and imprison you forever!

00:17:40.018 --> 00:17:41.019
Icky!

00:17:47.734 --> 00:17:48.735
Where are we?

00:17:49.611 --> 00:17:53.282
A gold doubloon to the man
who first spies the white whale.

00:17:55.075 --> 00:17:56.201
Big whale over there!

00:17:56.326 --> 00:17:58.120
Arr! I saw it first.

00:18:00.455 --> 00:18:02.457
Wait! That no white whale.

00:18:02.541 --> 00:18:03.667
It gray thinkie whale.

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:06.211
Queequeg, let go of me. I have to kill it!

00:18:06.295 --> 00:18:07.629
Farewell!

00:18:07.713 --> 00:18:11.216
You will all be trapped
in this dense symbolist tome,

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:12.467
forever!

00:18:14.344 --> 00:18:15.846
Follow him! It's our only way out.

00:18:24.521 --> 00:18:25.522
Excuse me.

00:18:25.606 --> 00:18:26.899
Have you seen a giant brain?

00:18:26.982 --> 00:18:30.027
Yep. I let him help me whitewash
Aunt Polly's fence.

00:18:30.444 --> 00:18:32.905
Tom Sawyer, you tricked me.

00:18:32.988 --> 00:18:35.949
This is less fun
than previously indicated.

00:18:36.033 --> 00:18:40.621
Let this corny slice of Americana
be your tomb for all eternity.

00:18:40.704 --> 00:18:42.122
- Please, no!
- Come on!

00:18:51.215 --> 00:18:54.635
Mr. Fry, Mama tells us
you're quite the oddity.

00:18:54.718 --> 00:18:56.345
A bachelor at your age.

00:18:56.428 --> 00:18:58.388
You think I'm an oddity?
Wait till you see...

00:18:58.472 --> 00:19:02.059
Presenting the most eligible landowner
in all Hertfordshire,

00:19:02.142 --> 00:19:03.685
Mr. Brainley.

00:19:03.769 --> 00:19:05.729
I'm a gigantic brain.

00:19:05.812 --> 00:19:08.398
- I say!
- Most ungentleman-like!

00:19:08.482 --> 00:19:11.902
Mr. Brainley,
what news have you of the London season?

00:19:11.985 --> 00:19:14.238
- Well...
- Hey, brainy! Think fast!

00:19:14.321 --> 00:19:16.573
I always think fast.

00:19:16.907 --> 00:19:19.201
The whale, he be white now!

00:19:26.708 --> 00:19:28.377
Leela, I've got an idea.

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:29.837
Stay here with Queequeg.

00:19:32.548 --> 00:19:34.800
Is there Mrs. Queequeg?

00:19:40.639 --> 00:19:41.890
I'm free!

00:19:43.767 --> 00:19:44.893
All right, brain!

00:19:44.977 --> 00:19:47.437
Get ready for some electroshock treatment!

00:20:04.162 --> 00:20:05.831
Fry, don't die!

00:20:05.914 --> 00:20:06.915
Wake up!

00:20:09.376 --> 00:20:13.630
No!

00:20:17.551 --> 00:20:21.388
"Leela cried for her lost love
as Fry lay dead under the heavy bookcase.

00:20:21.471 --> 00:20:24.516
"The Big Brain laughed in triumph.

00:20:24.683 --> 00:20:27.603
"Then, for no reason,
he left Earth forever.

00:20:27.686 --> 00:20:29.271
"The end." There!

00:20:29.354 --> 00:20:31.273
Now he's trapped in a book I wrote.

00:20:31.356 --> 00:20:34.443
A crummy world of plot holes
and spelling errors.

00:20:34.526 --> 00:20:37.446
The Big Brain am winning again!

00:20:37.529 --> 00:20:39.698
I am the greetest!

00:20:41.366 --> 00:20:43.285
Now I am leaving Earth

00:20:43.368 --> 00:20:45.245
for no raisin!

00:20:50.959 --> 00:20:52.836
The Big Brain is defeated.

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:55.339
Let what must be done be done.

00:21:02.554 --> 00:21:03.764
Me...

00:21:03.847 --> 00:21:05.098
Feel...

00:21:05.182 --> 00:21:08.602
A bit better in cognitive faculties.

00:21:08.685 --> 00:21:09.686
I did it!

00:21:10.187 --> 00:21:13.565
And it's all thanks to the books
at my local library.

00:21:15.609 --> 00:21:18.153
And so life returned to normal,

00:21:18.237 --> 00:21:21.073
or as normal as it gets
on this primitive dirt ball

00:21:21.156 --> 00:21:22.991
inhabited by psychotic apes.

00:21:23.492 --> 00:21:25.577
Thanks to the effect of the brain rays,

00:21:25.661 --> 00:21:28.830
the people of Earth had no memory
of what had transpired,

00:21:28.914 --> 00:21:30.332
except Fry.

00:21:30.415 --> 00:21:33.335
And no one believed him
or cared what he had to say.

00:21:35.045 --> 00:21:37.673
I, meanwhile, returned to my post,

00:21:37.756 --> 00:21:41.134
ever vigilant, lest Earth again
come under brain attack.

00:21:41.218 --> 00:21:44.012
And when that day comes,God help us.

00:21:44.763 --> 00:21:46.723
God help us all.

00:21:47.307 --> 00:21:49.017
Time for a diapie change!

00:21:50.310 --> 00:21:51.812
End transmission.